SUMMARY:Mahjong 101 + Open Play
DESCRIPTION:LEARN + PLAY SATURDAY AT ROOTS \n\n\nWant to learn American Mahjong? Already know how to play and just want a seat at the table? Join West Wind Mahjong Society for a Learn + Play Saturday at Roots in Garden City!\n Saturday\, October 10 Roots Juice Co & Wellness Studio\, 214 N Main St | Garden City\, KS\nMAHJONG 101 | 9 AM–12 PM\nOPEN PLAY | 1–4 PMBrand new to Mahjong? Start here! We’ll walk you through the basics of American Mahjong\, from understanding the tiles and NMJL card to Charleston\, gameplay\, strategy and calling your first Mahj. No experience needed. We provide everything you need to play.\n\nAlready know how to play? Pull up a chair! Open Play is for experienced players and anyone who takes our Mahjong 101 class that morning. It’s the perfect chance for new players to put what they just learned into practice while it’s still fresh.\n\nCome for Mahjong 101\, Open Play\, or make a day of it and join us for both!\n Mahjong 101: $50/person Open Play: $5/person Equipment provided Food and drinks available for purchase from Roots\n\nGrab a friend\, choose your session\, and come spend a Saturday around the Mahjong table.\nREGISTER ONLINE–> https://westwindmahjongsociety.com/register\nWhere Good Company is Always in Play.
URL:https://www.visitgck.com/event/mahjong-101-open-play/
LOCATION:Roots Juice Co. & Wellness Studio\, 216 North Main\, Garden City\, KS\, 67846\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Events
END:VEVENT
