SUMMARY:Garden City Arts: Writers Meetup
DESCRIPTION:Calling all writers! Whether you are published\, writing poems or prose for personal enjoyment\, or just beginning your writing journey\, this quarterly meetup is designed to support and connect writers in our community. Garden City Arts’ Writers Meetup offers a welcoming space for networking\, discussion\, and creative encouragement.\n\nWriters may also choose to submit work for group critique through an online portal below. Submissions Guidelines include:**Submissions MUST be fewer than 5 pages.**Submissions must be submitted 1 week prior to the Meetup.**Writers must be present at the meetup for their work to be discussed. Please only submit work if you are able to attend.\n\nRegister or submit your work for a group critique here: Garden City Arts Website\n\nOct 10th | 10AM-12PMAges 14+ | FREELocation: Garden City Arts\, 318 N Main StAdvance registration is encouraged.
URL:https://www.visitgck.com/event/garden-city-arts-writers-meetup-2/
LOCATION:Garden City Arts\, 318 N Main St\, Garden City\, KS\, 67846\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Events
END:VEVENT
