SUMMARY:Emerald City Gala - The Annual Wine Tasting Event
DESCRIPTION:Tickets are STILL available for the Emerald City Gala! Follow the glow and join us for an unforgettable evening at the Garden City Area Chamber of Commerce Annual Wine Tasting! Enjoy a night filled with wine\, whiskey\, spirits\, beer\, cigars & more while sipping\, socializing\, and supporting the Chamber. Whether you’re planning a date night\, girls’ night\, or an evening out with friends\, you won’t want to miss one of our favorite events of the year! Emerald City Gala – Annual Wine Tasting\nMUST BE 21+ to attend this event!!!!! Saturday\, October 10 7:00–10:00 PM The Refinery\, 3122 Cecil Dr Tickets: $100 General Admission\, $50 Allocated Whiskey Room TicketThere’s still time to grab your ticket and join us somewhere over the rainbow! Get yours before they’re gone!https://business.gckschamber.com/…/wine-tasting-event…
URL:https://www.visitgck.com/event/emerald-city-gala-the-annual-wine-tasting-event/
LOCATION:The Refinery Event Center\, 3122 Cecil Dr\, Garden City\, KS\, 67846\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Events
END:VEVENT
