SUMMARY:Gravity Wellness Spa Halloween Hootenanny
DESCRIPTION:🎃👻 THE 4TH ANNUAL HALLOWEEN HOOTENANNY IS BACK! 👻🎃 \nMark your calendars and bring the whole family for an afternoon of Halloween fun\, local businesses\, food\, candy\, costumes\, music\, and community! We are so excited to bring back one of our favorite community events for its 4th year! Last year\, more than 350 people joined us\, and we’re expecting an even bigger crowd this year! 🎃 The Halloween Hootenanny is all about bringing our community together and supporting the amazing local businesses that make Garden City such a great place to live. Bring your family. Bring your friends. Bring your appetite. And definitely bring your Halloween spirit! Admission is FREE! \n📅 Sunday\, October 11\, 2026\n⏰ 1:00 PM – 5:00 PM\n📍 Gravity Wellness Spa\, 1106 N. Campus Drive\, Garden City\, KS \n🎶 THIS YEAR\, WE’RE TURNING UP THE VIBE!\nWe’re excited to have a DJ joining us this year to keep the energy going and set the perfect Halloween Hootenanny vibe! 🎶👻\nCome ready for music\, fun\, dancing\, costumes\, and plenty of Halloween spirit! \n🍬 TRUNK-OR-TREAT\nKids will receive a Gravity treat bag to use while visiting participating local businesses and food trucks throughout the event.\nCome dressed in your favorite Halloween costume and get ready to fill your bag with treats! 👻🍭 \n🛍️ SHOP LOCAL\nWe’ll have a fantastic lineup of local businesses\, vendors\, and food trucks joining us for the afternoon.\nCome support local businesses\, discover something new\, grab some delicious food\, and enjoy everything our community has to offer! \n🧒 KID’S ZONE\nOur Kid’s Zone will be located at the back of the property and will feature a bounce house and other fun activities for the kids! \n🎁 GIVEAWAYS\nWe’ll have several Gravity Wellness Spa service drawings\, along with giveaways from participating local businesses. There will be lots of chances to win something fun! 🎉 \n👻 COME IN COSTUME!\nHalloween costumes are highly encouraged! Whether you’re going for cute\, spooky\, funny\, or completely over-the-top\, we want to see your Halloween spirit!
URL:https://www.visitgck.com/event/gravity-wellness-spa-halloween-hootenanny/
LOCATION:Gravity Wellness Spa\, 1106 N Campus Drive\, Garden City\, KS\, 67846\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Events
END:VEVENT
