SUMMARY:Garden City Arts: ArtFULL Mornings
DESCRIPTION:Fill your morning with art\, learning\, and creativity!\n\nArtFULL Mornings is a free monthly program for adults that combines art history\, hands-on creativity\, and conversation. Each month\, Conny will introduce an artist\, movement\, or moment in art history through a short presentation and discussion. Then\, Robin will lead a simple art project inspired by what you’ve learned. No art experience is necessary\, and coffee is provided!\n\nRegister here: Garden City Arts Website\n\nOctober Topic: What Makes Modern Art Modern?\nOct. 13 | 10–11:30 AM\nAges 18+ | FREE\nLocation: Garden City Arts\, 318 N Main St\nAdvance registration is required. Space is limited to 12 participants.
URL:https://www.visitgck.com/event/garden-city-arts-artfull-mornings/
LOCATION:Garden City Arts\, 318 N Main St\, Garden City\, KS\, 67846\, United States
