SUMMARY:GPMS Class: Gingerbread Zombie Man
DESCRIPTION:Come glaze a cute Christmas\, er\, Halloween ornament with us! Each participant will glaze a pre-made clay gingerbread ornament. You don’t *have* to make him a zombie\, but it is spooky season. \n\n\nGPMS will provide the bisque\, glaze\, instructions\, and tools needed for this project. You will glaze the project during the class. It will be kept at the makerspace to dry and be fired. It will be available for pick up about one week after class. You will be contacted by the instructor.\n\nThis class costs $15 for non-members and $10 for members. If there is no one registered for class approximately 24 hours in advance\, class may be cancelled. Register here: GPMS Website\n\nWednesday\, October 14 | 6:30pm\nGreat Plains MakerSpace\, 2308 N 3rd St
URL:https://www.visitgck.com/event/gpms-class-gingerbread-zombie-man/
LOCATION:Great Plains MakerSpace\, 2308 N. Third Street\, Garden City\, KS\, 67846\, United States
